{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2023-04-11 16:15:00', 'title': 'SYSTECH ADDRESSES UPDATED DSCSA REQUIREMENTS FOR PHARMACEUTICAL SUPPLY CHAIN', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL. , APRIL 11, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SYSTECH, PART OF MARKEM-IMAJE AND DOVER (NYSE: DOV), A LEADING PROVIDER OF DIGITAL IDENTIFICATION AND TRACEABILITY SOFTWARE SOLUTIONS, ANNOUNCED A SERIES OF SERVICES DESIGNED TO HELP CUSTOMERS IN THE PHARMACEUTICAL SUPPLY CHAIN MEET DRUG SUPPLY CHAIN SECURITY ACT (DSCSA) INTEROPERABILITY REQUIREMENTS BY THE NOVEMBER 27 DEADLINE.'}